      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The 7 hops (each phase has its own diagram below)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The 7 hops (each phase has its own diagram below)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "01-the-example:pr1-43",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24.5,
      "y": 772,
      "width": 852.5390625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ag",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 600329458,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1663120558,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703568915,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  DNS sends the user to the closest region (us-east-1)        <- by the USER's location\n2  TCP + TLS to the public load balancer, which forwards to the ingress\n3  the ingress asks its LOCAL TCS: 'acme?'  ->  'eu-west-1, shard 9'  <- by the TENANT's home\n4  the ingress forwards the request to Europe over AWS's network\n5  shard 9's load balancer picks any Jira node   6  Jira asks TCS: which DB?   7  reads jira_acme",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  DNS sends the user to the closest region (us-east-1)        <- by the USER's location\n2  TCP + TLS to the public load balancer, which forwards to the ingress\n3  the ingress asks its LOCAL TCS: 'acme?'  ->  'eu-west-1, shard 9'  <- by the TENANT's home\n4  the ingress forwards the request to Europe over AWS's network\n5  shard 9's load balancer picks any Jira node   6  Jira asks TCS: which DB?   7  reads jira_acme",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
